What changed on [[Pride Of The Empire (V)]] between [[Pride Of The Empire (V)]] (left) and [[Pride Of The Empire (V) (Errata)]] (right): the changed area cropped from the two published Players Committee card images, pixels unchanged (the left image turned to the right image's orientation where they are stored differently), placed side by side. Left: [[:File:V11-D-prideoftheempire-20190802.gif]] ([https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/60afbbd/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual11-Dark/large/prideoftheempire.gif Holotable commit 60afbbd]). Right: [[:File:V11-D-prideoftheempire.gif]] ([https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/168657a/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual11-Dark/hires/prideoftheempire.png Holotable commit 168657a]).

